        "committer": {
          "name": "Oleg Drokin",
          "email": "green@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-08-23 09:30:02.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-19744 doc: fix the llapi_ioctl(3) example",
        "message": "LU-19744 doc: fix the llapi_ioctl(3) example\n\nThe example tested an uninitialized rc rather than fd, so a failed\nopen() went unnoticed, and it handed LL_IOC_GROUP_LOCK a pointer where\nthe kernel reads the argument as the group id by value.  Use an ioctl\nthat takes a buffer, and adopt the argc and include conventions of the\nneighbouring pages.\n\nFixes: 594b780062db (\"LU-16634 misc: replace obsolete ioctl numbers\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Id22bb4ba031177baab8803d2bb20962ce5738eca\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
